      "content": "hey can u help me draft a quick summary for a non-tech stakeholder? i need to explain the difference between vertical scaling and horizontal scaling in AWS specifically for our microservices setup. we're seeing some spikes in traffic and i need to justify moving more towards auto scaling groups. keep it professional but easy to grasp for someone in finance.",
